#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:477
msgid ""
"Added support for user attributes for Enterprise Advanced licensed "
"servers. Defined policies that automatically grant channel memberships "
"based on user attributes. Membership updates happen automatically when "
"user attributes change — no need for manual role adjustments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:478
