#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:803
msgid ""
"Removed the automatic Elasticsearch/OpenSearch channel index schema "
"check. As a result, admins will no longer receive Direct Message alerts "
"to notify that their ``elasticsearch`` channel index is out of date."
