#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:900
msgid ""
"A new index to the ``CategoryId`` column in ``SidebarChannels`` table was"
" added to improve query performance. No database downtime is expected for"
" this upgrade. It takes around 2s to add the index on a table with 1.2M "
"rows for PostgreSQL, and it takes around 5s on MySQL on a table with 300K"
" rows. The migrations are fully backwards-compatible and no table locks "
"or existing operations on the table are impacted by this upgrade. Zero "
"downtime is expected when upgrading to this release. The SQL queries "
"included are ``CREATE INDEX idx_sidebarchannels_categoryid ON "
"SidebarChannels(CategoryId);`` for MYSQL and ``CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY "
"IF NOT EXISTS idx_sidebarchannels_categoryid ON "
"sidebarchannels(categoryid);`` for PostgreSQL."
msgstr ""

