msgid "Improved the handling of Thai script in search terms."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1048
msgid "Added tooltips to the buttons shown in the channel info in the right pane."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1049
msgid "Downgraded Spanish language to Alpha."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1050
msgid "Removed the feature to import themes from Slack."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1053
msgid ""
"Redis is now available as an alternative cache backend for all Enterprise"
" customers. It can be leveraged to run Mattermost at a very high scale."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1054
msgid ""
"Plugins are now allowed to add Support Packet data without user interface"
" elements."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1055
msgid ""
"Improved the detection of the mobile app operating system as stored in "
"the **Sessions** table."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1058
#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1069
msgid "Fixed an issue where imported replies were missing their reactions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1059
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue with how links in Markdown headings are displayed in the "
"Threads list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1060
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where marking a channel as read wouldn't persist through a"
" refresh."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1061
msgid ""
"Fixed a warning in the Support Packet about an unreadable LDAP server "
"even if LDAP was disabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1062
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where multiple timezones were highlighted when selecting "
"certain timezones."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1063
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where unread messages on other teams would not appear "
"after the application reconnected to the server."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1064
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the scrollbar was not clickable when there was a "
"toaster."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1065
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue when pressing **Page Up** or **Page Down** on a long "
"message (scrollable) with the right sidebar open."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1066
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue with incorrect reporting in the **Server Updates** section"
" in **System Console > Workspace Optimizations**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1067
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where EXIF rotated image previews did not have the correct"
" size."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1068
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the search input field in the emoji picker did not "
"accept uppercase letters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1070
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where System Administrators could not pull posts from "
"Direct Message channels that they were not in."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1071
#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1311
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue by restoring System Administrator access to Direct and "
"Group Messages without being a member."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1077
msgid "Under ``LocalizationSettings`` in ``config.json``:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1078
msgid ""
"Added a new ``EnableExperimentalLocales`` configuration setting that "
"controls whether to allow the selection of experimental (e.g., in "
"progress) languages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1082
msgid ""
"Added ``CacheType``: This can be either ``lru`` or ``redis``. ``lru`` is "
"the default choice which will use the in-memory cache store that we use "
"currently."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1083
msgid "Added ``RedisAddress``: The hostname of the Redis host."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1084
msgid ""
"Added ``RedisPassword``: The password of the Redis host (can be left "
"blank if there is no password)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1085
msgid "Added ``RedisDB``: The database of the Redis host. Typically ``0``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1086
msgid ""
"Added ``DisableClientCache``: This can be set to ``true`` if you decide "
"to disable the client-side cache of Redis. Typically there is no need to "
"do this in production, and this is mainly used as a test option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1087
msgid "Under ``FileSettings`` in ``config.json``:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1088
msgid ""
"Added new ``AmazonS3StorageClass`` and ``ExportAmazonS3StorageClass``, "
"both default to ``\"\"`` to preserve the current behavior. Administrators"
" may configure this storage class to the storage class required by their "
"S3 solution."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1091
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Added a new query string to exclude threads that are not part of the team"
" ``GET "
"api/v4/users/{user_id:[A-Za-z0-9]+}/teams/{team_id:[A-Za-z0-9]+}/threads``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1094
msgid "Added a new ``server_hostname`` field to the websocket ``HELLO`` event."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1097
msgid "v10.4 is built with Go ``v1.22.6``."
msgstr ""

