"Updated the channel header to hide pinned posts when there aren't any in "
"the channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1245
msgid ""
"Added full support for @mentions in the values of fields in [message "
"attachments](https://developers.mattermost.com/integrate/reference"
"/message-attachments/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1248
msgid ""
"Added a new URL parameter called ``permanent`` to ``DELETE /api/v4/posts"
"/<post-id>``, and set ``permanent`` to ``true`` in order to permanently "
"delete a post and its attachments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1249
msgid ""
"Added Connected Workspaces (Beta) administration page to the System "
"Console when Connected Workspaces are "
"[enabled](https://docs.mattermost.com/onboard/connected-workspaces.html"
"#enable-connected-workflows) for the server."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1250
msgid ""
"Added a team selector to accept connection invite flow in Connected "
"Workspaces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1251
msgid ""
"Restricted activation and deactivation of LDAP-managed users through both"
" the System Console UI and Mattermost API."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1252
msgid ""
"Export/import improvements: added the ability to export all user "
"preferences and flagged posts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1253
msgid "Increased timeouts to fetch cluster logs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1254
msgid "Improved log messages for cluster communication."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1255
msgid "Information about deleted rows from the Data Retention job are now logged."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1256
msgid "License details to logs are now emitted when added or removed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1257
msgid ""
"Added a new mmctl command, ``mmctl post delete <post-id>``, in order to "
"permanently delete a post and its attachments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1260
msgid ""
"Added metrics to prometheus to check the mobile versions for each session"
" daily."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1261
msgid ""
"Improved the performance of LDAP sync jobs when group-contained teams and"
" channels are used."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1262
msgid "Added minor improvements to notification metrics."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1263
msgid "Added minor improvements to mobile push notifications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1266
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue with email notifications using 24-hour timestamps by "
"default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1267
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where bots were not ignored when counting deactivated "
"accounts for statistics."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1268
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where drafts didn’t allow scrolling if the user had many "
"drafts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1269
msgid "Fixed an issue that caused Javascript errors in the System Console."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1270
msgid "Fixed racy use of session in ``NewWebConn``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1271
msgid ""
"Fixed a race condition that would happen after a server start if "
"``EnableTesting`` was enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1272
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where no error message was shown when replying to a "
"deleted post from the draft screen."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1273
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the check icons were missing from the Sort and Show "
"options in the Direct Messages tab, and the Sort tab of the Channels tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1274
msgid ""
"Fixed desyncing issues with unreads between the team sidebar and the "
"title bar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1275
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue with message export file attachments with dedicated "
"filestore: when the dedicated filestore is set, file attachments will be "
"found and exported correctly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1276
#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1322
#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1416
msgid ""
"Reverted a change enforcing usernames to start with alpha characters on "
"the server."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1277
#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1323
#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1417
msgid ""
"Reverted a breaking change in ``registerSlashCommandWillBePostedHook`` "
"that caused errors to surface in case an expected empty object was "
"returned."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1284
msgid ""
"Added a new configuration setting ``EnableAPIPostDeletion`` in order to "
"enable/disable post deletion. This configuration setting does not need to"
" be enabled when running mmctl in local mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1285
msgid ""
"Added ``EnableDesktopLandingPage`` to allow the desktop app landing page "
"to be disabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1287
msgid ""
"Added a configuration setting ``MobileExternalBrowser`` that tells the "
"Mobile app to perform SSO Authentication using the external default "
"browser."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1290
msgid "v10.2 is built with Go ``v1.22.6``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1293
msgid ""
"The scrollbar is not clickable when there is a \"Jump to recents\" "
"toaster."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1294
msgid "Shared Channels: Direct Messages are not supported."
msgstr ""

