msgid ""
"Enabled [Channel Bookmarks](https://docs.mattermost.com/end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.html), added re-ordering, and "
"fixed URL validity checking."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1346
msgid ""
"Added a more descriptive error message, \"Uploaded plugin size exceeds "
"limit.\" for plugin uploads that are too large."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1347
msgid "Added channel specific message notification sounds configuration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1350
msgid ""
"Added ``DeleteAt`` field for ``SharedChannelRemotes`` and "
"``RemoteClusters``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1351
msgid ""
"Added support for sending channel invites to offline remotes in Shared "
"Channels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1352
msgid ""
"Changed server-side logic to return a ``413: Request Entity Too Large`` "
"HTTP status code for a plugin upload that is too large."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1353
msgid ""
"Direct and Group Message unread/read state over export and import will "
"now be carried over."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1354
msgid "CRT memberships are now importable for import."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1355
msgid "CRT memberships are now exportable for bulk export."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1356
msgid "Added ``--local mode`` support in MMCTL to handle user preferences."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1357
msgid ""
"Plugins are now allowed to mark setting fields as secret, obfuscating "
"them in the System Console and the Support Packet."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1360
msgid "Improved metrics related to push proxy errors."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1361
msgid "Improved metrics around notifications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1364
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where threads would be marked as read if they were open in"
" the background."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1365
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where Direct and Group Messages didn't load correctly in "
"the sidebar when refreshing the app from Drafts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1366
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue attempting to bind to Apps plugin when the plugin was not "
"enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1367
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the Unreads tab would not update correctly after the"
" websocket reconnected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1368
msgid "Fixed an issue with focusing on the main box when loading the app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1369
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where Team and Channel Admins could lose the ability to "
"create posts in a moderated channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1370
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where marking a channel as unread did not show immediately"
" in other clients."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1371
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue with not allowing to use ``@`` and ``~`` in the ``in:`` "
"search modifier without affecting search results."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1372
msgid "Fixed an issue with YouTube previews no longer being displayed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1379
msgid ""
"Added ``YoutubeReferrerPolicy`` to fix an issue where YouTube previews "
"showed an “Video Unavailable” error instead of the video."
msgstr ""

