msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1414
msgid "**10.0.2, released 2024-10-28**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1415
msgid ""
"Mattermost v10.0.2 contains a high severity level security fix. "
"[Upgrading](https://docs.mattermost.com/upgrade/upgrading-mattermost-"
"server.html) to this release is recommended. Details will be posted on "
"our [security updates page](https://mattermost.com/security-updates/) 30 "
"days after release as per the [Mattermost Responsible Disclosure "
"Policy](https://mattermost.com/security-vulnerability-report/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1418
msgid "Mattermost v10.0.2 contains no database or functional changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1419
msgid "**10.0.1, released 2024-10-10**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1420
msgid ""
"Mattermost v10.0.1 contains low to medium severity level security fixes. "
"[Upgrading](https://docs.mattermost.com/upgrade/upgrading-mattermost-"
"server.html) to this release is recommended. Details will be posted on "
"our [security updates page](https://mattermost.com/security-updates/) 30 "
"days after release as per the [Mattermost Responsible Disclosure "
"Policy](https://mattermost.com/security-vulnerability-report/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1421
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue enabling Professional customers and Team Edition users to "
"upgrade to Playbooks v2 via the in-product marketplace, which fails to "
"start without an Enterprise License. Additional details and discussion "
"can be found on the [forums here](https://forum.mattermost.com/t"
"/clarification-on-playbooks-in-mattermost-v10/20563)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1422
msgid "Mattermost v10.0.1 contains no database or functional changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1423
msgid "**10.0.0, released 2024-09-16**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1424
msgid "Original 10.0.0 release."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1427
msgid ""
"We no longer support new installations using MySQL starting in v10. All "
"new customers and/or deployments will only be supported with the minimum "
"supported version of the PostgreSQL database. End of support for MySQL is"
" targeted for Mattermost v11."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1428
msgid ""
"Apps Framework is deprecated for new installs. Please extend Mattermost "
"using webhooks, slash commands, OAuth2 apps, and plugins."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1429
msgid ""
"Mattermost v10 introduces Playbooks v2 for all Enterprise licensed "
"customers. Professional SKU customers may continue to use Playbooks v1 "
"uninterrupted which will be maintained and supported until September "
"2025, followed by an appropriate grandfathering strategy. More detailed "
"information and the discussion are available on the [Mattermost "
"discussion forum](https://forum.mattermost.com/t/clarification-on-"
"playbooks-in-mattermost-v10/20563)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1430
msgid ""
"Renamed ``Channel Moderation`` to ``Advanced Access Control`` in the "
"channel management section in the **System Console**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1431
msgid "Renamed announcement banner feature to “system-wide notifications”."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1432
msgid ""
"Renamed “Collapsed Reply Threads” to “Threaded Discussions” in the System"
" Console."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1433
msgid ""
"Renamed “System Roles” to “Delegated Granular Administration” in the "
"System Console."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1434
msgid "Renamed \"Office 365\" to \"Entra ID\" for SSO logins."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1435
msgid ""
"Fully deprecated the ``/api/v4/image`` endpoint when the image proxy is "
"disabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1436
msgid ""
"Pre-packaged Calls plugin [v1.0.1](https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-plugin-calls/releases/tag/v1.0.1). This includes breaking "
"changes including removal of group calls from unlicensed servers in order"
" to focus supportability and quality on licensed servers. Unlicensed "
"servers can continue to use Calls in direct message channels, which "
"represent the majority of activity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1437
msgid ""
"Removed deprecated ``Config.ProductSettings``, ``LdapSettings.Trace``, "
"and ``AdvancedLoggingConfig`` configuration fields."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1438
msgid "Removed deprecated ``pageSize`` query parameter from most API endpoints."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1439
msgid ""
"Deprecated the experimental Strict CSRF token enforcement. This feature "
"will be fully removed in Mattermost v11."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1442
msgid ""
"If you upgrade from a release earlier than v9.11, please read the other "
"[Important Upgrade Notes](https://docs.mattermost.com/upgrade/important-"
"upgrade-notes.html)."
msgstr ""

