msgid ""
"Changed the right-hand side scroll direction and fixed the advanced text "
"editor to the bottom."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1463
msgid ""
"Added [Do not disturb and late timezone "
"warnings](https://docs.mattermost.com/end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-"
"types.html#direct-message-channels) to Direct Message posts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1464
msgid "Added user statuses to the Group Members modal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1465
msgid ""
"Added labels for channel header and purpose in the right-hand side "
"channel info view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1466
msgid ""
"Added pagination support to the **Integrations > Incoming WebHooks** page"
" to be able to navigate through all configured incoming webhooks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1467
msgid "Made various improvements to code involving user preferences."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1468
msgid "Promoted GIF picker, custom groups and message priority out of Beta."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1469
msgid ""
"Removed the **Pre-release features** section from **Settings > Advanced**"
" due to lack of usage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1472
msgid ""
"Made payload size limit error more clearly visible and recognisable in "
"API responses and server error logs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1473
msgid ""
"Extended the plugin schema to support defining sections for **System "
"Console** settings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1474
msgid ""
"Added support for a default team on secure connections for incoming "
"channel invites."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1475
msgid ""
"Remote clusters can now be created without explicitly providing a "
"password."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1476
msgid ""
"Files are now fetched from all nodes in a cluster when generating a "
"Support Packet."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1477
msgid "Docker images are now based on Ubuntu Noble."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1480
msgid "Removed a re-render on channel change."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1481
msgid ""
"Batched requests made by certain components for loading users and their "
"statuses from the server."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1482
msgid "Cleaned up some unused post handling logic."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1485
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue with web app notifications not being shown in the "
"**Notification Center** on Windows or Mac."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1486
msgid "Fixed an issue with ``mmctl webhooks list`` to paginate past 200 results."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1487
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where scrolling capability and a visible scrollbar were "
"missing in post textboxes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1488
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where false warnings about Channel indexes being incorrect"
" were sent to system admins."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1489
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where indexing would always be done async even after "
"setting ``LiveIndexingBatchSize`` to ``1``. Now we respect the config and"
" index synchronously if the value is set to ``1``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1490
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the **Edit Post Time Limit** button was not being "
"displayed in the System Console."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1491
msgid ""
"Fixed another issue where users would not see channels they were added "
"to/messages from those channels in clustered environments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1498
msgid ""
"Added a new setting ``MaximumURLLength`` to remove the hardcoded URL "
"length limit."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1499
msgid "Removed deprecated ``Config.ProductSettings``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-v10-changelog.md:1500
